manifest and impending pathologic fractures of the femoral neck by cemented hemiarthroplasty</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Related Res</source><year>1990</year><volume>260</volume><fpage>220</fpage><lpage>3</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gardner</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Flik</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name><name><surname>Mooar</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improvement in the undertreatment of osteoporosis following hip fracture</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Am</source><year>2002</year><volume>84-A</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>1342</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12177263</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heikkinen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Jalovaara</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hip fractures in Finland and Great Britain - a comparison of patient characteristics and outcomes</article-title><source>Int Orthop</source><year>2001</year><volume>25</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>349</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11820439</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b15"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lyons</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical outcomes and treatment of hip fractures</article-title><source>Am J Med</source><year>1997</year><volume>103</volume><issue>2A</issue><fpage>51S</fpage><lpage>64S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9302897</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McNeil</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Value of bone scanning in neoplastic disease</article-title><source>Semin Nucl Med</source><year>1984</year><volume>14</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>277</fpage><lpage>86</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6387915</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>